WEBVTT

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:01.563
From this point onwards, close your eyes,

00:07:01.587 --> 00:07:03.408
do not say anything, do not open them,

00:07:03.432 --> 00:07:05.000
be aware of the sensations.

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:14.976
Yes or no, did you feel anything?

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:16.001
Nicole: Yes.

00:07:16.025 --> 00:07:18.038
KB: You did feel that? What did you feel?

00:07:18.062 --> 00:07:19.714
Nicole: A touch on my back.

00:07:19.738 --> 00:07:21.452
KB: How many times did you feel it?

00:07:23.252 --> 00:07:24.300
Nicole: Twice.

00:07:24.324 --> 00:07:26.990
KB: Twice. OK, extend your left arm
out in front of you.

00:07:27.014 --> 00:07:28.445
Extend your left arm, OK.

00:07:29.550 --> 00:07:30.976
OK, keep it there.